  "record": {
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "1. When moving from prone -> standing, you don't travel \"through\" the crouching stance, which results in an awkward just...floating from the ground into standing.\n2. Holding W to move forward when prone, turning the camera to the side, and continuing to hold W will have you keep moving in the original direction. But that's obviously not how it should work. Movement is camera relative. Doing this when walking will make your character turn and start moving in the direction your camera is pointing, and prone should be the same.",
